    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50917" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσάκῐς</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐσᾰ</span>],
			Adv. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴσος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the same number of times, as many
